---
source: crates/safix/src/reporter.rs
expression: render_plain(&refusal)
---
safix: flake.safix.users.dave holds no secret, so there is nothing to choose
from. Nothing was decrypted.

This is a state of the declarations rather than of the session: the same
run on a terminal, with a preview, over a user who holds something would
have offered it. safix list dave prints the same emptiness without
refusing.

safix edit additionally offers nothing for a user who holds only public
outputs: a public output is refused for editing, so a choice that offered
one would be offering a refusal.
